
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Question Queue</title>
      <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
     <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
     <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter+Tight:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
     <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&family=Caveat:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
     <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/75136afa19.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
   <header>
        <h1>NightLog</h1>
        <nav>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#howItWorks" >How it works</a></li>
            <li><a href="#features" >Features</a></li>
             <a href="/signup"><button class="logBtn">Open the Log</button></a>
        </ul>
       
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!--Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section">
    <h2>Every car, <em> logged</em></h2>
    <h2>No more <em>paper</em>.</h2> 
    <p>NightLog replaces the handwritten overnight sheet with a fast, searchable log — with a timestamp, a clean plate and the attendant’s name on every entry.</p>
    <a href="/login"><button class="logBtn">Stat Logging</button></a>

    <div class="image-wrapper">
         <img src="/image/nightlog-table.png" alt="">
    </div>
       
      </section>

      <!-- Why it helps section -->

            <section class="why-it-help-container">
                <span>Features</span>
            <h2>What paper gets wrong</h2>
            <p>Three problems with the printed sheet, and how NightLog fixes each one.</p>

                <section class="why-it-helps-layout">
            <div class="box">
            <h3>No times</h3>
            <p>Every car gets an automatic logged-at time.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
            <h3>Misspelled makes</h3>
            <p>Pick from a dropdown — no typos.</p>
            </div>

       
            <div class="box">
            <h3>Who logged it?</h3>
            <p>Each entry records the attendant’s name.</p>
            </div>
            </section>

         </section> 


      <!-- How it works -->
            <section class="how-it-works-container">
                 <span>HOW IT WORKS</span>
            <h2>Three steps, all <em> shift </em> long </h2>

                <section class="how-it-works-layout">  
            <div class="box">
                <div class="circle"><span>1</span></div>
                <h3>Log the car</h3>
                <p>Type the plate, pick the make, model and color. The time and your name are added for you.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="circle"><span>2</span></div>
                <h3>See tonight's list</h3>
                <p>Every car logged tonight in one list. Type part of a plate to find it fast.</p>
            </div>

       
            <div class="box">
                <div class="circle"><span>3</span></div>
                <h3>Fix or remove mistakes</h3>
                <p>Typed a plate wrong? Edit the entry. Logged a car twice? Delete it.</p>
            </div>
               </section>

         </section> 

</body>
</html>